          "type": "text",
          "text": "I found six civic happenings in Hanover for 2026-11-19 to 2027-05-18. None were cancelled or postponed. The town hasn't posted a 2026–27 list of free holiday parking days yet, and the South Main Street rebuild isn't funded for construction, so neither is listed below.\n\nEVENT: New South Main Street parking rates. They start January 11, 2027, all day, at the meters on South Main Street. The host is the Hanover Selectboard and the Hanover Police Parking and Downtown Division. This is a one-time change that stays in place. "
        },
        {
          "citations": [
            {
