              "title": "Hanover increases parking fees, effective in January - Valley News"
            }
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "text": "South Main Street from Wheelock Street to Lebanon Street, known as Parking Zone 7533 that encompasses about 43 parking spaces"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ". Parking there "
        },
        {
          "citations": [
            {
              "type": "web_search_result_location",
              "cited_text": "South Main Street from Wheelock Street to Lebanon Street, known as Parking Zone 7533 that encompasses about 43 parking spaces, will see an increase fr...",
              "url": "https://vnews.com/2026/11/10/hanover-increases-parking-fees-effective-in-january/",
