            }
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "text": "will see an increase from the original rate of about $1.50 per hour to $2 an hour for the first three hours, then $5 an hour for hours four through eight."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " The change "
        },
        {
          "citations": [
            {
              "type": "web_search_result_location",
              "cited_text": "It would replace the two-hour limit on Main Street parking with an eight-hour limit, but raise the rates based on duration. ",
