        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n\nEVENT: Parklet (outdoor seating) season, May 1 to September 30, 2027, on South Main Street. The host is the Town of Hanover, and the season repeats every year. The changes approved in January 2027 shorten the season, "
        },
