          "type": "text",
          "text": "allowing restaurants to take over spaces for outdoor seating, will go up by $825 per space."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " This takes some South Main Street parking spaces out of use from May 1, 2027.\n\nEVENT: Winter overnight parking ban, November 15, 2026 to April 30, 2027, from 12:01 to 7 a.m., on all town streets and lots. The host is the Hanover Police Department, and the ban repeats every year. "
