          "text": "The ban includes all Town streets and lots, with the only overnight parking allowed under covered sections of the Hanover Parking Garage at 7 Lebanon Street."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n\nEVENT: Free parking on town holidays during the window: Thanksgiving (Nov 26, 2026), Christmas (Dec 25, 2026), New Year's Day (Jan 1, 2027), Martin Luther King Jr. Day (Jan 18, 2027) and Presidents' Day (Feb 15, 2027). It covers all meters and the town garage, is hosted by the Town of Hanover and repeats every year. The dates are my own calculation from the town's holiday list. "
        },
        {
          "citations": [
            {
              "type": "web_search_result_location",
              "cited_text": "There is free parking at all meters and in the Parking Garage at 7 Lebanon Street on holidays observed by the Town of Hanover each year.\n\n",
              "url": "https://www.hanovernh.org/253/Public-Holidays---Free-Parking",
