          "text": "\n\nEVENT: FY27 paving night work, spring 2027 (no exact dates), 7 p.m. to 7 a.m., on South Park Street (Lebanon Street to East Wheelock) and East Wheelock Street (Park Street to South Balch). The host is Hanover Public Works and its contractor, and this is one project. The bid specifications say "
