          "type": "text",
          "text": " am. Evening diners using these streets could face delays.\n\nEVENT: Hanover School District Annual Meeting, Saturday, February 27, 2027, 11:30 a.m., at Hanover High School. The host is the Hanover School District (SAU 70), and it repeats every year. The SAU 70 page lists the "
